                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1f41e268-16ef-4196-8aa7-0f88b160dceb",
                                "sense_id": "5355599a-f3cd-324d-a6c6-d63893cd9dae",
                                "text": "Ка́ждый день дул стра́шный ве́тер, а за ночь на снегу́ образова́лся твёрдый, льди́стый слой на́ста, по кото́рому за́яц пробега́л, не оставля́я следов.",
                                "translation": "Every day there was an awful wind, and during the night a hard icy crust formed on the snow, on which the hares could run without leaving a trace.",
                                "english": "Every day there was an awful wind, and during the night a hard icy crust formed on the snow, on which the hares could run without leaving a trace."
